Node ID=20 Darkwood
Text=Well, the cavern below my home is rich in Darkwood - a rare kind of wood that grows only in certain types of caves.  I placed my home here to take advantage of that, cornered the market as it were.  It's lonely living so deep in the forest, but selling Darkwood has made me a wealthy man.  Listen, if you help me find my daughter, I'll make it worth your while.  Will you help?
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=woodcutter req Darkwood Qst assigned
Custom Requirement=CActionExpression
{
Action=CNotAction
{
Action=CCheckExistenceAction
{
Name To Check For=Darkwood cave cleared of undead
Desired Minimum Count=1
}
}
}
